  "story": {
    "text": "Restless Jo goes to New York, to work as a {GOVERNESS} in a boarding-house. There she meets Professor Bhaer, a poor, {KINDLY} German teacher, with holes in his {SOCKS} and {POCKETS} full of {BOOKS}. He teaches her German, and she {MENDS} his {COATS}.",
